Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.94,0:00:10.82,Default,,0,0,0,,美游大人！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.72,0:00:18.18,Default,,0,0,0,,這…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.86,0:00:27.94,Default,,0,0,0,,到… 到此為止了嗎…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.08,0:00:41.14,Default,,0,0,0,,伊莉… 雅？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.94,0:00:44.50,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉我來晚了 美游
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.88,0:00:46.56,Default,,0,0,0,,為什麼…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.54,0:00:49.22,Default,,0,0,0,,對我來說 美游是…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.24,0:00:52.26,Default,,0,0,0,,重要的…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.82,0:00:56.90,Default,,0,0,0,,朋友嘛！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.21,0:02:30.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)\pos(972.111,710.909)\3c&HFC8CFC&\fs45\fn方正粗圆_GBK\bord5\shad0\b1}萬花筒
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.21,0:02:30.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)\3c&H1E476B&\fs45\fn方正粗圆_GBK\bord2.5\shad0\b1\pos(972.111,710.909)}萬花筒
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.38,0:02:30.04,Default,,0,0,0,,凜！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.16,0:02:30.96,Default,,0,0,0,,露維亞！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.46,0:02:33.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Anfang！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.22,0:02:34.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Zeichen！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.18,0:02:40.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fs35}Gleipnir{\r}\N縛獸之六枷！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.78,0:02:43.58,Default,,0,0,0,,有效！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.54,0:03:02.88,Default,,0,0,0,,瞬間契約級別的魔術果然有效呢
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.54,0:03:02.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fs35\pos(426.667,658.2)}tencount
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.00,0:03:13.06,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎麼會來這裡
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.14,0:03:15.12,Default,,0,0,0,,對不起
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.08,0:03:19.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我真是個笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.12,0:03:21.68,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼覺悟都沒有
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.18,0:03:23.90,Default,,0,0,0,,只是被別人牽著鼻子走
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.76,0:03:28.96,Default,,0,0,0,,總感覺事不關己 這種事不是現實…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.52,0:03:31.16,Default,,0,0,0,,但是…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.90,0:03:36.88,Default,,0,0,0,,一旦知道這就是現實 是危險的事
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.88,0:03:38.86,Default,,0,0,0,,突然感覺一切都好可怕
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.04,0:03:41.74,Default,,0,0,0,,伊莉雅…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.02,0:03:43.52,Default,,0,0,0,,但是
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.10,0:03:45.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我最笨的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.16,0:03:47.22,Default,,0,0,0,,是我選擇了逃避
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.96,0:03:50.64,Default,,0,0,0,,沒有考慮朋友的心情
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.96,0:03:56.38,Default,,0,0,0,,美游明明連我的份都一起努力了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.70,0:03:58.26,Default,,0,0,0,,所以…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.34,0:04:00.54,Default,,0,0,0,,對不起！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.40,0:04:02.98,Default,,0,0,0,,雖然可能有點遲了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.32,0:04:06.30,Default,,0,0,0,,但我想再次和美游一起戰鬥
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.52,0:04:10.28,Default,,0,0,0,,因為讓朋友一個人置身險地
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.84,0:04:12.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我做不到！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.80,0:04:17.60,Default,,0,0,0,,謝謝你…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.36,0:04:22.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我也想和伊莉雅一起戰鬥
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.54,0:04:24.86,Default,,0,0,0,,和朋友一起
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.48,0:04:30.06,Default,,0,0,0,,走吧 美游
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.02,0:04:33.32,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.64,0:04:39.16,Default,,0,0,0,,看起來 我們完成使命了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.60,0:04:41.16,Default,,0,0,0,,雖然發生了很多
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.52,0:04:44.20,Default,,0,0,0,,但總算是水到渠成了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.36,0:04:49.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我本來就不擔心那邊…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.62,0:04:52.10,Default,,0,0,0,,頭疼的是寶石用過頭啦！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.42,0:04:55.54,Default,,0,0,0,,真是的 這種時候還說這個
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.08,0:04:57.30,Default,,0,0,0,,所以說女屌絲啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.42,0:04:59.22,Default,,0,0,0,,少囉嗦 暴發戶
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.38,0:05:10.52,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼會有這種傢伙
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.96,0:05:13.84,Default,,0,0,0,,連魔獸都能束縛住的枷鎖也要扯斷嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.16,0:05:15.80,Default,,0,0,0,,這是有多逆天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.22,0:05:23.68,Default,,0,0,0,,寶石也所剩無幾了…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.78,0:05:25.32,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.58,0:05:29.42,Default,,0,0,0,,那麼 要怎麼辦呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.94,0:05:31.72,Default,,0,0,0,,久等了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.12,0:05:33.64,Default,,0,0,0,,凜 露維亞
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.20,0:05:38.56,Default,,0,0,0,,那個… 我們有個想法
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.76,0:05:41.44,Default,,0,0,0,,哈？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.68,0:05:44.56,Default,,0,0,0,,你是認真的嗎 美游
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.72,0:05:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,只能做了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.76,0:05:55.54,Default,,0,0,0,,這場賭博很危險啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.98,0:05:56.76,Default,,0,0,0,,知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.30,0:05:59.40,Default,,0,0,0,,結界破裂的同時一起上
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.06,0:06:11.92,Default,,0,0,0,,各自散開！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.76,0:06:52.24,Default,,0,0,0,,最大功率
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.70,0:06:56.50,Default,,0,0,0,,全力一擊！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.32,0:07:00.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fs35}fire{\r}\N炮射
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.28,0:07:11.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fs35}Gáe{\r}\N突穿…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.50,0:07:14.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fs35}Bolg{\r}\N死翔之槍！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.44,0:07:29.78,Default,,0,0,0,,美游~
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.48,0:07:31.46,Default,,0,0,0,,作戰成功?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.28,0:07:37.52,Default,,0,0,0,,成功了… 嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.72,0:07:55.22,Default,,0,0,0,,凜
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.38,0:07:56.08,Default,,0,0,0,,露維亞
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.30,0:07:58.94,Default,,0,0,0,,這種程度不要緊的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.18,0:08:00.46,Default,,0,0,0,,比起這個…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.40,0:08:07.52,Default,,0,0,0,,又復活了…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.16,0:08:10.78,Default,,0,0,0,,到底要打倒多少次…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.46,0:08:15.90,Default,,0,0,0,,不妙 已經彈盡糧絕了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.32,0:08:17.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我也是…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.22,0:08:34.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我上
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.58,0:08:35.60,Default,,0,0,0,,伊莉雅掩護我
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.04,0:08:50.48,Default,,0,0,0,,不… 我不要緊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.90,0:08:56.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我… 多虧美游
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.52,0:08:58.10,Default,,0,0,0,,似乎明白了一點
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.98,0:09:01.60,Default,,0,0,0,,棄朋友於不顧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.10,0:09:03.76,Default,,0,0,0,,是沒法前進的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.58,0:09:07.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我也是
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.72,0:09:08.86,Default,,0,0,0,,似乎明白了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.94,0:09:12.48,Default,,0,0,0,,就算一個人做不到
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.92,0:09:14.58,Default,,0,0,0,,兩人一起就能成功
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.42,0:09:18.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我保證
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.04,0:09:22.02,Default,,0,0,0,,絕對不會再扔下朋友逃走
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.76,0:09:24.20,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 我相信你
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.98,0:09:25.98,Default,,0,0,0,,相信伊莉雅
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.86,0:09:29.02,Default,,0,0,0,,相信我的好朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.02,0:09:31.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fs35}parallel include{\r}\N並列限定展開！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.48,0:09:49.12,Default,,0,0,0,,這… 這是…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.18,0:09:51.32,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.38,0:09:56.60,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼都能做到
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.44,0:09:58.36,Default,,0,0,0,,只要兩人在一起！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.96,0:10:01.24,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 前進吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.80,0:10:03.62,Default,,0,0,0,,兩人一起！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.66,0:11:20.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Archer
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.62,0:11:21.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Lancer
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.74,0:11:22.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Rider
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.68,0:11:23.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Caster
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.56,0:11:24.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Saber
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.62,0:11:25.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Assassin
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.72,0:11:27.04,Default,,0,0,0,,還有Berserker
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.06,0:11:30.24,Default,,0,0,0,,卡片全部回收完畢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.66,0:11:32.06,Default,,0,0,0,,這樣就完成啦
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.56,0:11:33.74,Default,,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.00,0:11:35.20,Default,,0,0,0,,為了表示慶祝
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.38,0:11:37.18,Default,,0,0,0,,來一發大大的禮炮！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.24,0:11:39.28,Default,,0,0,0,,喂… 你想做什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.56,0:11:41.78,Default,,0,0,0,,這種時間會打擾到別人
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.26,0:11:42.90,Default,,0,0,0,,美游大人
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.10,0:11:45.10,Default,,0,0,0,,似乎不是這個問題
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.88,0:11:46.32,Default,,0,0,0,,伊莉雅
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.86,0:11:47.32,Default,,0,0,0,,美游
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.56,0:11:48.10,Default,,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.70,0:11:50.70,Default,,0,0,0,,雖說是我們把你們捲了進來
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.06,0:11:52.94,Default,,0,0,0,,但真是多虧有你們
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.58,0:11:57.10,Default,,0,0,0,,單憑我們 恐怕贏不了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.72,0:12:04.14,Default,,0,0,0,,一路戰鬥到最後 謝謝你們
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.70,0:12:07.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我也要感謝你們
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.24,0:12:10.02,Default,,0,0,0,,好…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.66,0:12:13.82,Default,,0,0,0,,那麼 這卡片由我送去倫敦…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.56,0:12:23.14,Default,,0,0,0,,最後的最後你還是大意了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.56,0:12:24.78,Default,,0,0,0,,放心吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.18,0:12:29.54,Default,,0,0,0,,卡片全都由我送到大師父那裡去
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.72,0:12:30.80,Default,,0,0,0,,可惡
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.68,0:12:33.56,Default,,0,0,0,,你想獨佔功勞嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.70,0:12:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,該死！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.74,0:12:37.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs40}丟死人了 遠阪凜
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.36,0:12:39.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs40}誰讓你大意了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.02,0:12:43.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs40}輸掉的猴子就吃你的香蕉去吧…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.64,0:12:44.54,Default,,0,0,0,,那麼 回家吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.34,0:12:49.72,Default,,0,0,0,,就這樣 發生了種種之後
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.16,0:12:54.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我們的漫長夜晚宣告結束
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.62,0:13:03.22,Default,,0,0,0,,伊莉雅
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.96,0:13:05.78,Default,,0,0,0,,伊莉雅…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.48,0:13:11.98,Default,,0,0,0,,哥哥？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.06,0:13:16.40,Default,,0,0,0,,這樣啊 我回來了來著
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.64,0:13:19.50,Default,,0,0,0,,不快點起床會遲到哦
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.00,0:13:23.06,Default,,0,0,0,,…哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.24,0:13:25.68,Default,,0,0,0,,喂喂 你睡迷糊了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.84,0:13:27.30,Default,,0,0,0,,可能吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.26,0:13:31.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我昨天好努力的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.62,0:13:34.22,Default,,0,0,0,,所以作為獎勵…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.32,0:13:37.04,Default,,0,0,0,,喂 伊莉雅
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.90,0:13:41.46,Default,,0,0,0,,早安的… 吻
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.50,0:13:44.30,Default,,0,0,0,,啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.90,0:13:58.54,Default,,0,0,0,,伊… 伊莉…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.68,0:14:03.02,Default,,0,0,0,,大清早就聽到少女的尖叫
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.02,0:14:06.26,Default,,0,0,0,,美游是怎麼叫她起床的…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.36,0:14:09.56,Default,,0,0,0,,…抱歉 美游 我把你當成哥哥了…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.68,0:14:13.34,Default,,0,0,0,,不 不對！ 是做夢 是dream…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.48,0:14:15.02,Default,,0,0,0,,冷靜點 伊莉雅
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.24,0:14:16.92,Default,,0,0,0,,不要緊 沒關係的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.34,0:14:22.62,Default,,0,0,0,,對不起 美游…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.90,0:14:26.22,Default,,0,0,0,,不 只是太突然了讓我有點吃驚
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.28,0:14:29.96,Default,,0,0,0,,但是 伊莉雅喜歡的話…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.46,0:14:32.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我會努力的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.24,0:14:34.32,Default,,0,0,0,,下次會好好…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.32,0:14:35.86,Default,,0,0,0,,打住！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.98,0:14:36.98,Default,,0,0,0,,不是的！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.12,0:14:38.90,Default,,0,0,0,,不是你想的那樣！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.04,0:14:40.68,Default,,0,0,0,,伊莉雅
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.04,0:14:41.66,Default,,0,0,0,,手絹呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.88,0:14:42.60,Default,,0,0,0,,紙巾呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.08,0:14:43.76,Default,,0,0,0,,沒問題
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.50,0:14:47.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我出門啦
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.70,0:14:49.76,Default,,0,0,0,,真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.16,0:14:51.64,Default,,0,0,0,,急匆匆的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.32,0:14:55.12,Default,,0,0,0,,但是 伊莉雅變得好有精神
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.48,0:14:58.84,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 昨晚明明那麼消沉
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.24,0:15:00.64,Default,,0,0,0,,出什麼事了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.20,0:15:04.00,Default,,0,0,0,,有精神就好
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.78,0:15:07.00,Default,,0,0,0,,太太！ 早上好
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.36,0:15:08.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Guten Morgen~
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.02,0:15:10.46,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 早上好
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.58,0:15:12.90,Default,,0,0,0,,你們倆怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.30,0:15:15.20,Default,,0,0,0,,還在擔心伊莉雅嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.82,0:15:17.10,Default,,0,0,0,,可是太太…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.46,0:15:20.62,Default,,0,0,0,,想起昨晚的外出… 伊莉雅她是不是…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.82,0:15:22.54,Default,,0,0,0,,塞拉真喜歡操心
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.90,0:15:24.30,Default,,0,0,0,,沒有的事…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.74,0:15:25.86,Default,,0,0,0,,沒關係
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.26,0:15:29.22,Default,,0,0,0,,昨晚似乎只是去見朋友了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.64,0:15:32.10,Default,,0,0,0,,她本人也變得很有精神啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.56,0:15:35.46,Default,,0,0,0,,話雖如此…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.30,0:15:38.82,Default,,0,0,0,,對對 塞拉太能操心了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.92,0:15:40.84,Default,,0,0,0,,是你太放任她了！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.68,0:15:45.38,Default,,0,0,0,,那麼 我也差不多該走了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.60,0:15:47.74,Default,,0,0,0,,咦 已經要走了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.08,0:15:49.34,Default,,0,0,0,,好急啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.18,0:15:52.52,Default,,0,0,0,,因為切嗣在那邊等我嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.06,0:15:54.48,Default,,0,0,0,,不能扔下他一個人
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.06,0:15:55.62,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.84,0:15:57.54,Default,,0,0,0,,而且
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.06,0:15:58.84,Default,,0,0,0,,而且？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.90,0:16:05.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我有確認到寶貝女兒的成長啦
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.54,0:16:08.82,Default,,0,0,0,,大意了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.06,0:16:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,今天是我和美游值日來著
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.14,0:16:12.64,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.30,0:16:16.28,Default,,0,0,0,,哎呀 多虧你來叫我起床
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.58,0:16:19.42,Default,,0,0,0,,畢竟昨晚累壞了 怕你起不來
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.60,0:16:20.30,Default,,0,0,0,,以防萬一
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.62,0:16:23.16,Default,,0,0,0,,這樣啊 多謝啦 美游
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.32,0:16:25.94,Default,,0,0,0,,這點小事沒什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.86,0:16:27.36,Default,,0,0,0,,可是…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.30,0:16:31.26,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 這樣下去只能勉強趕上呢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.60,0:16:32.58,Default,,0,0,0,,別說勉強了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.58,0:16:33.64,Default,,0,0,0,,基本出局定了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.08,0:16:35.90,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 沒辦法
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.12,0:16:37.14,Default,,0,0,0,,這樣的話…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.40,0:16:39.88,Default,,0,0,0,,周圍沒有人影
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.64,0:16:41.08,Default,,0,0,0,,紅寶石~
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.40,0:16:42.34,Default,,0,0,0,,來啦
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.54,0:16:44.04,Default,,0,0,0,,要來一發嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.56,0:16:45.64,Default,,0,0,0,,沒辦法
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.94,0:16:47.44,Default,,0,0,0,,美游大人 我們也來
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.04,0:16:50.52,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 趁周圍沒人
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.40,0:16:53.04,Default,,0,0,0,,compact full open
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.40,0:16:55.56,Default,,0,0,0,,境界迴廊 最大展開
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.96,0:17:00.72,Default,,0,0,0,,跑步來不及的話
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.86,0:17:02.04,Default,,0,0,0,,就從天上去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.60,0:17:02.96,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.70,0:17:08.70,Default,,0,0,0,,和朋友… 一起上學
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.90,0:17:12.10,Default,,0,0,0,,美游 你說什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.00,0:17:16.90,Default,,0,0,0,,沒什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.98,0:17:37.28,Default,,0,0,0,,該怎麼說呢…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.52,0:17:42.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我已經搞不懂你們的關係了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.12,0:17:45.32,Default,,0,0,0,,昨天不是還吵架來著
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.58,0:17:47.80,Default,,0,0,0,,呃 是你的錯覺吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.08,0:17:49.28,Default,,0,0,0,,肯定全部都是…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.52,0:17:51.82,Default,,0,0,0,,一晚上就嬌成這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.22,0:17:52.76,Default,,0,0,0,,這是…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.08,0:17:57.94,Default,,0,0,0,,該燒的伊莉子 背著我們把美游線打通了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.26,0:18:00.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我也要摸！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.60,0:18:03.30,Default,,0,0,0,,關係好是好事呀
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.90,0:18:05.36,Default,,0,0,0,,你們和好了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.62,0:18:06.82,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.96,0:18:10.00,Default,,0,0,0,,這樣啊 太好了呢 兩位
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.94,0:18:17.52,Default,,0,0,0,,說實話 一晚上突然變成這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.86,0:18:20.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我也完全摸不著頭腦…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.86,0:18:22.20,Default,,0,0,0,,算了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.74,0:18:24.64,Default,,0,0,0,,既然美游醬嬌了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.86,0:18:26.92,Default,,0,0,0,,今後也和我好好相處吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.04,0:18:28.34,Default,,0,0,0,,哈？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.18,0:18:31.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我憑什麼要和你好好相處
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.08,0:18:32.36,Default,,0,0,0,,哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.16,0:18:36.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我的朋友只有伊莉雅一個
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.86,0:18:38.78,Default,,0,0,0,,和你們沒有關係吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.78,0:18:47.94,Default,,0,0,0,,你… 把她搞哭了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.20,0:18:50.10,Default,,0,0,0,,喂 美游！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.50,0:18:52.92,Default,,0,0,0,,你生什麼氣
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.44,0:18:56.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我的朋友一生只要伊莉雅一個
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.92,0:18:59.38,Default,,0,0,0,,其他人怎麼樣都無所謂吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.48,0:19:00.70,Default,,0,0,0,,這是什麼 好沉重！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.82,0:19:03.20,Default,,0,0,0,,話說對於朋友的解釋是不是有點怪！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.48,0:19:04.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我… 我不懂…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.28,0:19:07.24,Default,,0,0,0,,不 雖然先前就這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.56,0:19:11.00,Default,,0,0,0,,完全搞不懂美游在想什麼！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.82,0:19:13.46,Default,,0,0,0,,你們已經不需要了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.22,0:19:17.52,Default,,0,0,0,,不許再靠近我和伊莉雅
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.78,0:19:24.22,Default,,0,0,0,,不好 龍子淚崩了！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.30,0:19:26.72,Default,,0,0,0,,伊莉雅 快想個辦法！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.92,0:19:27.84,Default,,0,0,0,,…我嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.18,0:19:30.38,Default,,0,0,0,,冷靜點 龍子
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.74,0:19:32.10,Default,,0,0,0,,美游只是在害羞
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.32,0:19:34.28,Default,,0,0,0,,不是她的本意啦
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.28,0:19:35.98,Default,,0,0,0,,是我的本意沒錯啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.98,0:19:38.32,Default,,0,0,0,,用那種一塵不染的眼神…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.58,0:19:41.68,Default,,0,0,0,,美游~
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.00,0:19:44.62,Default,,0,0,0,,雖然戰鬥已經結束
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.82,0:19:49.26,Default,,0,0,0,,但搞不好真正的麻煩才剛開始
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.96,0:19:53.64,Default,,0,0,0,,還有 要說凜和露維亞怎樣了…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.62,0:19:58.44,Default,,0,0,0,,哈？ 什麼意思？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.50,0:20:00.86,Default,,0,0,0,,就是我說的意思
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.02,0:20:03.74,Default,,0,0,0,,回收卡片辛苦了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.52,0:20:06.44,Default,,0,0,0,,這樣一來冬木的地脈也會安定吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.64,0:20:12.58,Default,,0,0,0,,遵守約定 收你們為徒也未嘗不可
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.70,0:20:15.24,Default,,0,0,0,,大師父是這樣說的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.48,0:20:16.24,Default,,0,0,0,,那麼…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.64,0:20:19.10,Default,,0,0,0,,但是 他還這樣說
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.84,0:20:21.12,Default,,0,0,0,,在學習魔術之前
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.28,0:20:24.10,Default,,0,0,0,,你們完全沒有一般常識
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.38,0:20:28.92,Default,,0,0,0,,幸運的是 你們現在所處的日本
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.74,0:20:32.84,Default,,0,0,0,,是個強調協調性 以和為貴的國家
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.58,0:20:34.86,Default,,0,0,0,,留學期間是一年
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.46,0:20:38.46,Default,,0,0,0,,去把吵架壞大事的性格改掉
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.16,0:20:41.28,Default,,0,0,0,,要收徒弟也是在那之後
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.98,0:20:42.92,Default,,0,0,0,,就這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.04,0:20:56.12,Default,,0,0,0,,開什麼玩笑！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.28,0:21:01.04,Default,,0,0,0,,看來 這個麻煩而喧囂的關係
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.46,0:21:03.96,Default,,0,0,0,,還要繼續下去
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.74,0:22:45.62,Default,,0,0,0,,到啦~
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.76,0:22:50.90,Default,,0,0,0,,對不起…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.28,0:23:02.50,Default,,0,0,0,,不好意思…
